window.products.push({"id":955094,"name":"Ninja DCT401 12-in-1 Double Oven with FlexDoor, FlavorSeal & Smart Finish, Rapid Top Convection and Air Fry Bottom , Bake, Roast, Toast, Air Fry, Pizz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9PTD9QaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet the Ninja Double Oven, the countertop oven that unlocks the power of two ovens in the counter space of one. Only Ninja has the FlexDoor that creates 2 separate ovens so you can cook 2 meals, 2 ways at different temperatures and cooking times. Use just the Top Rapid Oven for quick snacks, sides, and sheet pan meals—or the Bottom Convection & Air Fry Oven for larger roasts, bakes, or air frying up to 6 lbs of wings. You can also sync both independent ovens to cook a full course meal that finishes cooking at the same time with Smart Finish technology. While your meal cooks, FlavorSeal technology prevents flavor crossover between ovens. Two oven cavities in one eliminate back-to-back cooking for 65% faster meal-making than your traditional oven so you can put your wall oven out of business. Plus, this countertop dual oven features 12 cooking functions for the ultimate versatility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l9PTD9QaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ninja","source_asin":"B0C6T62TRQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6T62TRQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6T62TRQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955095,"name":"NEKOCAT Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin 2PCS 20\"x26\" One Side 100% 22 Momme Mulberry Silk Bed Pillow case Hypoallergenic Soft Breathable Organic Pur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uwgb6ZnfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Tip: the Front of the Pillowcase is 100% Pure Mulberry Silk the Back of the Pillowcase is White and Made of 100% Satin Polyester 🎁[Superior 100% Silk Pillowcase]- NEKOCAT silk pillowcases are made of 100% Natural mulberry silk, both side 22 Monme. This material is ultra-soft, breathable, smooth, cool, skin-friendly and comfortable. Enjoy a sweet night starts from our all-new silk pillowcase and the silk pillowcase is a good choice as a 🎁 Gift🎁. 🎁[Health for Your Hair and Skin]- Natural silk contains 18 Amino Acids. This has the ability to fire fine molecules.Reduce bed hard, friction, and snag related split ends, so you wake up with hair that looks lush, flowing and tangle free. 🎁[Reinforced Edge]-Needle thread reinforces the edge. The pinhole is more stable and stronger than other pinholes by about one millimeter, making the sink pillowcase anti-offline, difficult to pull and damage, and more durable. 🎁[AB face & envelope design]-Our blissy pillowcase front made of 100% silk, the back is white and made of 100% silky satin polyester,unique AB face design that let you enjoy different tender. Envelope maximum opening design will not strain the fabric, you can easily put the pillow into silk Pillowcases more convenient and durable than zippers, so silk pillowcases can perfectly support your pillow overnight without moving around. 2PCS pillowcases are available at one price for easy replacement. 🎁[Exquisite Gift Wrapping]- Silk is a symbol of love and noble, elegance. If you are looking for a gift for yourself or your family or friends, this is the right product for you. Our products have a dark blue classic gift box packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51uwgb6ZnfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEKOCAT","source_asin":"B07ZSGFRM8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZSGFRM8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZSGFRM8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
