window.products.push({"id":955131,"name":"BINO | Clear Storage Organizer | THE HOLDER COLLECTION | Clear Containers for Organizing with Built-in Handles | Pantry Organization and Storage | Fri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ADs6-ia1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Space saver: We all need a little help keeping our homes clean and organized. With our BINO slim plastic storage containers, you can maximize storage space while saving time. These premium organizers are versatile enough to fit your refrigerator, pantry shelves, cabinets, and more. These storage bins can also be nested, so they don't take up much space when not in use. It makes your organization and storage easier and helps to keep your fridge and pantry looking neat and organized. Smart storage design: Our handy, low-profile fridge organizer is a convenient way to organize and group your pantry or any space. With handles, a portable design turns any shelf into a drawer, making it easy to pull out, slide and transport from shelf to shelf. A clean, clear, simple, elegant design makes these organizer bins perfect for use in the pantry, fridge, or on any shelf. Store your food in style! Visible & Accessible: Our clear pantry organizer bins are ideal for storing anything in your bathroom, pantry, or elsewhere in your home. The see-through design allows you to easily identify what's inside without having to dig through the bin, making it ideal for small pantries and fridges. Our organizing bins come in medium and large. The medium bin measures approximately 12\" L x 5\" W x 4.25\" H that can fit into most of your shelves and drawers. Strong & Sturdy: Our sturdy clear BFA-free plastic storage bins can be used to store your everyday home essentials and are built from thick, durable plastic that won't crack or break under pressure. These plastic containers are long-lasting yet lightweight that are built to last. And their easy-to-clean design makes keeping them clean a breeze. Organize your own spaces and use them to store them in closets, under desks, on shelves, and more! Multi-functional storage: Our versatile plastic storage boxes are a great solution for storing and organizing all your things. These clear storage bins with handles can fit any space and help you keep a tidy home. From the bathroom to the kitchen, they’re perfect for organizing every room of your home. Great for pantry, cabinets, or office storage. Stores juice boxes, bagged frozen vegetables, meat products, condiments, craft supplies, utilities, and much more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ADs6-ia1S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B09BS8W22J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BS8W22J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BS8W22J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955132,"name":"Yangogle Burlap Table Runner Rustic Vintage Lace Natural Jute Table Runner Lace Burlap Table Cover for Wedding Table Decorations Farmhouse Thanksgivin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Oe2ylVVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Simple Elegant Design: The burlap lace table runner combines vintage burlap with modern chic white lace in the middle. It will be great collocation with both rural and modern themes for wedding or other special occasions. khaki and white creates a simple elegant look. Simple style in classic color, easy to use to save time. It is not recommended to dye the table runner. Do not twist, wring, squeeze or tumble dry. Don't leave the burlap out in wet conditions, including fog. Material: 100% nature jute burlap, with fine white lace . The edges are serged neatly to prevent fraying, durable, its texture clear and well-distributed, the embroidered lace is sewn to prevent unraveling or curling up. Try not to machine wash and hand wash with water. Dry cleaning is recommended. One simple method of cleaning burlap fabric is to simply shake them and hang outside. The steam iron can be used to get wrinkles away, then dry with a towel. Suitable for Many Occasions: Ideal for decorating tables at parties, events, anniversary celebrations, Christmas or picnics. Since the material is natural jute, there will be some smell when receive it, please don't worry, it is safe and harmless. The sunlight might bleach away lighter stains and odors can air out. If 2 or 3 days time in the sun doesn't remove enough of the odor, sprinkle baking soda all over the burlap and leave the powder in place for at least a day to absorb the smell. Package Include: You will receive 10 packs natural jute burlap with lace table runner, our table runner size is 12*108 inch, come in good quality and are long enough to perfectly cover an up to 8 feet long table. It is vintage and will give a chic touch to your wedding table, party, or any occasion. With this burlap lace table runner, you can not only decorate your home or wedding, but also cut it off to required length to use as gift bows, garlands or ribbons floral. Great Gift Idea Burlap Runner for Table 108 in: This burlap table runner 108 inches long is a great gift, too. Gift it to your friends and family who need to decorate events, wedding, or party, you would receive lots of compliments from them. Burlap & Jute is not a perfect fabric. Slight imperfections can be expected with burlap. It will take you a few minutes to flatten it out. Due to the difference in screen, please allow the color of the product may be slightly different.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617Oe2ylVVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yangogle","source_asin":"B09PQHZBTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PQHZBTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PQHZBTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
