window.products.push({"id":955178,"name":"Loomie Vanity Desk with Lighted Big Mirror and Charging Station of Outlets & 2 USB Ports, Makeup Vanity with 9 Lights in 3 Colors & One Drawer, Dresse","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WxZajMvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✨【Become the Superstar You Have always Dreamed Of】Do you want to be the focus of your life? Having a exquisite makeup is the key. This vanity desk is with large mirror and 9 LED lights. There are three light modes setting (white, warm, cool) that offers different hue lights to illuminate skin tones and colors accurately, creating a flawless complexion and makeup with even the smallest amount of brushes. With dimming setting you can choose various brightness from brightest to medium or to low to suit you according to the indoor light, allowing you to create prefect daytime or evening makeup looks. No more worrying about a bad hair day. 💡【User Friendly】The vanity desk includes a built-in power strip with 2-outlets & 2 USB Ports provides convenience for charging your Hair Dryer, Hair Curling Irons, Hot Air Brush, Personal Care Devices and Smart Devices. Makeup, hair care, Hairstyling, phone charging can all be done directly in front of the vanity table, making everything more simple and within Reach. Like bring a movie stars dressing room studio into your room. ✨【Why Loomie Vanity Desk】With the chic style,Illuminated big mirrors and the combination of minimalist white finish and the gold stylish legs, make this vanity desk charming. With a drawer to make it more practical. It suits any room decor and exudes sophistication no matter where it is placed in the room. Moreover, it will be an ideal gift for yourself, your loved one or daughter on birthdays, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Christmas or other anniversaries. The design & quality makes it the best value for money & the best choice for you. 💄【Sturdy Construction】Made of sturdy metal frame, thickened shelf, Loomie vanity has durable and superior sturdy construction. The unique T-leg design makes the table more stable and gives it a modern look and gold accent. The whole frame is rust-proof, ensuring a consistent chic, minimalist look. Table legs with non-slip pads, non-slip and also to prevent the floor scratched. ✨【Easy to Assemble, Clear Instruction】All parts and accessories are numbered, and each step of the installation has detailed instructions, easy to understand and to assemble. 💄【Fast delivery & Perfect After-sales Service】 We have multi warehouses in the US, the shipping takes about 2-6 Business days(except for force majeure factors, such as hurricanes, etc.). In addition, if you have any product problems, please contact us in time, all problems will be solved within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WxZajMvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loomie","source_asin":"B0BJV9CYNF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJV9CYNF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJV9CYNF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
