window.products.push({"id":955267,"name":"Handmade Wooden Puzzle Jewelry Box from Kalotart. One of a Kind Magic Case with Hidden Key & Removable Compartments. Stunning, Impressive Gift. Like T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916XESB3nPL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"ONE OF A KIND HANDMADE Wooden Puzzle Jewelry Box from Kalotart. Each one is unique from all others. The fancy design on the top and sides will never be repeated. It's a very special gift box for yourself or someone you love. Through a few simple steps you can locate the hidden key, then open the box. There are secret removable compartments inside you can use to keep valuables or hide a special gift. Have fun challenging family and friends to open the box. No matter how handy and clever they are, friends won't be able to open it! Until YOU show them with a few simple steps. These are made in our family workshop in Romania where our community has been making these boxes since the 1770s. There is nothing else like it anywhere in the world.  SHHH DON'T TELL ANYONE. Here are the simple steps to opening your box:  1) Slide the front piece below the main body of the box to the left, as far as it will go.  2) Slide the main body of the box forward.  3) Slide and remove the panel containing the key and remove the key.  4) Slide down and remove the slat covering the keyhole.  5) Use the key to open the box.  HURRY AND BUY NOW while we have a fresh supply of these handmade jewellery boxes in plentiful supply. This makes a much appreciated gift to anyone who likes the European tradition not found in stores. External size: 6,3 x 4,1 x 3 inch / 16 x 10,5 x 7,5 cm. Inside compartment: 5,1 x 2,5 x 1,2 inch / 13 x 6,5 x 3 cm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/916XESB3nPL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B07Q8Z876R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q8Z876R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q8Z876R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
