window.products.push({"id":955286,"name":"Lavaux Designs Flat Acacia Wood Napkin Holder for tables, Natural rustic brown wooden base with black metal handle , farmhouse style, 8 * 7 inches.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"We at Lavaux Designs believe in delivering stylish products of high quality. Each of our product is unique and designed to suit consumer needs. Our napkin holders are handcrafted and made out of a single piece of Acacia wood known for its durability and strength and at the same time being environmentally safe. We strive to make cooking experience pleasurable for our customers. Disclaimer: Since each napkin holder is unique and made from a single piece of wood, look and texture of each product could be different. Care instructions: Use mild soapy water and soft sponge to clean. Use a cloth to wipe and let the napkin holder dry in air. Avoid direct exposure to sunlight. Avoid putting the napkin holder in dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAVAUX DESIGNS","source_asin":"B0949KYHX7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0949KYHX7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0949KYHX7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955287,"name":"Sauder Peppercorn Linen Tower, Soft White Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kv5xVnygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your bathroom deserves to look good too. Add a little style and a whole lot of storage to your bathroom with this linen tower from the Sauder Bath collection. This linen cabinet tower features open shelving with two adjustable shelves that can move to different heights to create flexible storage for items of all shapes and sizes. Conveniently store and display items like stacks of wash clothes, decorative plants, your bottles of perfume and a box of tissues. Also included is a cubbyhole divider for easy access towel storage. It has room for all your things! Behind the louver detailed door is an additional adjustable shelf for storage of items that you prefer not be seen. The reversible door opens left or right – you decide what suits you best! Finished in Soft White and detailed with attractive hardware, this towel tower will give your bathroom the style you want with the functionality that you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Kv5xVnygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B085JGFTCP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955287","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085JGFTCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085JGFTCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955288,"name":"Japanese Omelette Pan Nonstick Tamagoyaki Square Egg Pan, 7’’x 6’’ Retangle Small Frying Pan with Anti Scalding Handle, Silicone Spatula & Brush and Y","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dokpL7DpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Owning our omelette pan will allow you and your family to eat the famous Japanese tamagoyaki without leaving home. We will also provide you with the steps to make a variety of delicacies, so that you can experience the joy of making delicacies yourself. Are you ready? First gourmet—Tamagoyaki Step 1: Beat 3 eggs into a bowl and stir to boil. Step 2: Add a spoonful of white sugar, 1/2 spoon of salt, and 1-2 spoons of milk, stir well and set aside. Step 3: After the omelette pan is evenly heated, use an oil brush to oil the omelette pan. Step 4: Pour half of the egg liquid into the pot, keep it on a medium-low heat, and then use a silicone spatula to fold it a few times and push it to the front. Step 5: Pour the remaining egg liquid into the pot, and turn it over again with a spatula after forming. Step 6: After the Tamagoyaki is boiled out of the pot, cut into small pieces and put it on the yellow plate we give away. Food Two-Fried Chicken Wings Step 1: Pour the oil into the pot and use the oil brush to evenly brush the oil. Step 2: Wait for the pot to heat up and put the chicken wings into the pot. Step 3: Use chopsticks or shovel to turn the chicken wings continuously. Step 4: Wait for the chicken wings to fry until the surface is golden, then brush them with sauce. In addition to the two delicacies above, our pot can also produce many other delicacies. Hurry up and have it to make your gourmet creations. Product Features: Quick heat conduction,help you cook quickly and perfect. Easy to flip the eggs,sandwiches, pancakes and omelets. Unique and simple design, easy to clean. Product Specification: Measures Size:  Japanese Omelette Pan:6\" W x 1.4\" H x 7\" L (15x 3.5 x 18 cm), handle length 6.5\" (17cm).Weight:1.10lb（0.5kg） Yellow plate:6.3″ L x 4″ W. Weight:0.14lb（65g） Material: Aluminum alloy, wood, stainless steel. Applica","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dokpL7DpS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fancy Home","source_asin":"B093F8MT3S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093F8MT3S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093F8MT3S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955289,"name":"All-Clad Textiles 100-percent Cotton Fiber Reactive Apple and Pear Print Kitchen Towel, 17-inch x 30-inch, Sage Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912U+65ZIeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This All-Clad Fiber Reactive Printed Towel is the perfect addition of style and utility to your kitchen. Made from 100-percent cotton, this kitchen towel provides a plush, yet durable towel for all of your kitchen needs. The design is printed with a fiber reactive printing process that treats the towel to absorb the dye completely, which maintains the vibrant design and color integrity of the product. Each printed kitchen towel measures 17-inches wide by 10-inches long. These All-Clad Printed Kitchen Towels match with all other All-Clad kitchen towels, pot holders, and oven mitts in the same color for easy coordination throughout your kitchen. Features: Unique design: Each towel is fiber reactive printed for continued quality after use. Unique design: Each towel is fiber reactive printed for continued quality after use. Long-lasting: Made from durable, yet plush 100% cotton with satin edge hems. Long-lasting: Made from durable, yet plush 100% cotton with satin edge hems. Complete the set: Coordinates with other All-Clad Color Collections. Complete the set: Coordinates with other All-Clad Color Collections. Measurements: 17 x 30 inches. Measurements: 17 x 30 inches. Easy Care: For best results, wash prior to first use. Machine wash cold, tumble dry low. Easy Care: For best results, wash prior to first use. Machine wash cold, tumble dry low. Why Ritz? John Ritzenthaler Company has partnered with All-Clad Metalcrafters LLC, a professional, premium cookware manufacturer, to develop and produce a high quality textiles line to complement your home kitchen. This new line of textiles has been created with the same high regard to quality and performance, as All-Clad cookware, and has been developed to satisfy the design sensibilities of aspiring home cooks across the nation. This first ever All-Clad textile line comes in an array of 12 unique and exquisite colors that will beautifully coordinate with and enhance your home kitchen décor. The line includes: oversized solid and check kitchen towels; bold and unique fiber reactive printed kitchen towels; regular and premium silicone treated oven mitts and potholders; and oversized, easy storage dish drying mats.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912U+65ZIeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All-Clad","source_asin":"B00UABS2FO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UABS2FO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UABS2FO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
