window.products.push({"id":955312,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner Fan, Mini Fan Air Cooler with 3 Wind Speeds, Desktop Evaporative Air Humidifier, Cooling Fan with Anion for Bedroom, Office, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LzdJKDEPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5 in 1 Air Cooler Fan】Portable air conditioner is a combination of a desk fan, air cooler, aroma diffuser, night light, and humidifier. A small evaporative air cooler can be used throughout the year to cool you down in the hot summer, enjoy a cool summer, and humidify, moisturize and protect your skin in the dry autumn and winter. You can also add your favorite essential oils to diffuse the fragrance and fill the entire room. 【Energy Saving & Safety】The low-energy air conditioner fan is designed for personal use. It does not use refrigerants or chemicals to cool the air and is harmless to the environment. The mini fan only cools the user's surrounding environment. And the mini cooler fan adopts a closed fan blade design to prevent accidental contact between children and pets and ensure safety. 【Atomization Spray & 3 Wind Speeds】This personal air conditioner fan uses an enlarged air outlet and 2 sprayers. The ultrasonic atomization technology atomizes the water in the water tank into ultra-fine water molecules, which has a better cooling effect. There are three wind modes (low/medium/high). You can adjust the air volume according to your needs. ?TIP: The sound of fan blade vibration will increase with the increase of wind speed. 【Large Capacity Water Tank】You can add water or ice cubes to the top of the mini air conditioner to keep you away from the dryness and heat of summer. Keep your body cool at night and get a good night’s sleep. The large 300ML water tank can be sprayed continuously for 4-5 hours (depending on the fan speed). The water tank is made of high-quality ABS, which is durable. Removable design, easy to add water/ice, and clean. 【New Design 120°Rotation & Warm Color LED Night Light】 The air cooler can rotate 180° left and right. When we need to cool down quickly, turn off the shaking head function so that we can enjoy the high wind speed of rapid gathering and cooling.Portable air conditioner Built-in breathing LED light, soft light, can be used as a night light, allowing you to sleep well in the dark. It is the best choice for sleeping at night. Sleep mode, low noise: about 25 decibels.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LzdJKDEPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comfook","source_asin":"B09W5FGP9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W5FGP9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W5FGP9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
