window.products.push({"id":955531,"name":"Happybuy Citrus Juicer, Heavy Duty Manual hand Press, Stainless Steel Stand Juicer, Juicer Squeezer for Citrus Lemons Oranges","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RcJJU+WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy-duty Stainless Steel: Constructed with heavy-duty stainless steel material, featuring a food-grade 304 stainless steel strainer, this citrus juicer press is of 100% safety and hygiene. And due to its compact appearance, it is able to be stored everywhere. Efficient Juicing & Easy Cleaning: With a convex point design, the cone-shaped squeezing strainer can adapt to all sides of the fruit. The pulp and seeds are effectively separating from juice, to extract every last drop out of fruits. The dishwasher-safe strainer can be easily detached for easy cleaning, featuring a 0.8-inch (20 mm) diameter hopper outlet for the fast-flowing of the juice. Strong Stability Without Shaking: Our orange crush machine is equipped with a thickened reinforced base for improved stability. The large opening between the U-shaped feet can be used to place the container. Convenient Operation: This easy-to-use orange press adopts a long and light-weight pressure lever with a comfortable rubber grip, effectively stopping and reducing pressure on the hand. You just need to put the flat cut side of the fruit down on the strainer, then press down with the lever. You can enjoy the fresh juice in a second! For Various Kinds Of Fruits: You and your family will definitely love the healthy and nutritious juices, which are getting from oranges, limes, lemons, pineapples, grapefruits, apples, and other fruits. This orange juicer manual is perfect for restaurants, bars, families, parties, supermarkets, and other places that need lots of fresh juice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711RcJJU+WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Happybuy","source_asin":"B077ZRL12N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077ZRL12N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077ZRL12N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955532,"name":"Ann Clark Number 3 Cookie Cutter - 3 Inches - Tin Plated Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41b8AzkDZUL._AC_.jpg","description":"Family owned and operated since 1989, Ann Clark Cookie Cutters (The Cookie Cutter People from Vermont) has grown from a small gift company to the largest manufacturer of cookie cutters in America. Soon after its launch the company became a family affair. Very supportive from the outset, Ann's late husband John became Vice-President in 1996. That same year her late son, John Jr., served as a key player when he moved back to Vermont and daughter Elizabeth joined up as Sales Manager. She has since moved on to other endeavors. Ann's son Ben came on board in 1998 and is now the company's CEO. Grandchildren Margaret, Rebecca and Alistair can be seen in company catalogs and also lend their services as cookie makers, tasters, and decorators. Made in the USA is an important label to us. We pride ourselves on our ability to manufacture high quality competitively priced cookie cutters using American made materials and workers. Every cookie cutter is made using certified metal from United States Steel Corporation. Our manufacturing team enjoys a happy and healthy place to work and the folks answering our phones are sitting right here in Vermont. As a customer, you can count on quality products that are consistently available and ship right away. You will know you've purchased our American made cookie cutter by the \"Made in the USA\" label on every product. Thank you for choosing our American made cookie cutters. Our cookie cutters meet safety requirements under California's Proposition 65 for lead and cadmium, CPSIA for lead, Bureau Veritas country of origin marking, and FDA - GRAS for metal intended to come into contact with food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41b8AzkDZUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ann Clark Cookie Cutters","source_asin":"B00KJ8JY46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KJ8JY46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KJ8JY46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
