window.products.push({"id":955712,"name":"ALEVMOOM Arm Pillow Cuddle Pillow for Couples Neck Cervical Pillow Anti Hand Pressure Arched Shaped Pillow Memory Foam Slow Rebound Pressure Pillow Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-6m+3wBdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>【MADE MATERIAL】 Ice silk +100% Polyurethane pillow core + ABS plastic steel frame cover and inner memory foam. with high density slow rebound inner core, you can enjoy stress-free comfort and relaxation.</p> <p>【ERGONOMIC DESIGN】With Arched Tunnel design to ease the pressure on the arms, neck and spine when sleeping on your side or taking a nap. Couple pillow prevents the weight of the head from pressing on the arms, so it will not numb.</p> <p>【US PATENTED PRODUCTS】This sweet couple pillow has a patented support system. According to the curvature of the neck and waist, there are 4 cleverly placed U-shaped ABS plastic steel frames inside to help maintain good alignment of the neck and spine. Neck pillow for measures L13.8 x W13.8 x H7.1(Thick 3.4in of pillow).</p> <p>【MULTI-USE】Great for office, library, home, travel. Versatile pillow-tunnel design have you fall asleep quickly if you’re tired along on road trips or camping excursions, tummy sleep face down sleep and neck sleep can also be very comfortable. You can also use arm pillow to watching TV. Sweet couple sleeping pillow for relaxing on a sofa at home, a break in the office. Best gift for your friends and families.</p> <p>【QUALITY & MACHINE WASHABLE】We've great faith in our nap pillow. Of course, we use them ourselves! For 14 years, we've been doing our best to perfect our pillow design. The pillowcase is fine texture, feel soft, not wool, not ball. It is removable and very easy to clean, machine washable. So that you can achieve the most comfortable rest experience and relax your body and mind.</p>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-6m+3wBdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALEVMOOM","source_asin":"B0BCKFFXLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955712","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCKFFXLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCKFFXLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":955713,"name":"Green Tree Gallery Reclaimed Natural Barn Wood Picture Frame, for an 8 x 10 inch Photo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ftQpbLNjL._AC_.jpg","description":"To complete the look of your naturally rustic home decor, you need the rugged, weathered look of reclaimed barn wood picture frames. These frames are made of rough and natural old wood, complete with imperfections. You will love the look and love knowing your frames are environmentally friendly. These frames offer the 3-dimensional appearance of a frame within a frame. No need for matting here! The wood is rough and typically knotty, frequently with nail holes from its previous life as a fence post or barn. Photos install from the back. Great look for any style, any occasion photo. Outside dimensions measure 12 3/4 x 10 1/2 inches. Frame is 1 1/4 inches thick with protective glass. It holds an 8 x 10-inch picture. An easel is attached to the back for vertical or horizontal tabletop display.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ftQpbLNjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Green Tree Gallery","source_asin":"B01NCW3U54","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955713","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCW3U54","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCW3U54","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
