window.products.push({"id":955804,"name":"Decanters for Wine, NUTRIUPS Red Wine Decanter, Lead-free Wine Decanters, U Shape Wine Decanter, Hand Blown Wine Decanters and Carafes, U Shape Design","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714O1sHJKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Unique Double-opening Design】Different from most of the wine decanters with 1 opening, our decanters for wine with two-opening design make the air circulate better, which is conductive to letting air travel in and out. Accelerating the speed of decanting & Letting wine breath better, this wine decanter is nicer than those with aerators. It really changes the texture of the wine and makes it feel silky while releasing the floral and fruit aroma deep within, softening astringent tanning. 【Smaller Wine Decanter Spout, Easier to Pour】Compared with most glass wine decanters with only one large spout on the market, our U shaped decanters for wine with small-spout design are more practical. The smaller the openning, the faster the liquid flow rate. So, small spout can effectively reduce the wine-dripping problem by 99.99%. Forming and reinforcing the small spouts also put forward higher requirements on the craftsmanship of the making wine decanter. 【Truly Lead-free】Strictly controlling the quality of the raw materials and carefully screening them, we promise our decanters for wine are made of high-quality lead free crystal glass, which is safe and healthy. As we know, Lead leaching from glass into wine becomes an issue when wine stored for extended periods. It’s a subtle process and please choose truly lead free crystal glass wine decanters. 【Moderate Weight & Thicker and Sturdier】Are you always troubled by buying those paper-thin plastic-like red wine decanters? Do you feel upset because of the cumbersome glass wine decanters which are too heavy to use when holding wine? Please take a look at NUTRIUPS U shape decanter for wine! It's moderate in weight & easy to pick up and pour. We thicken the wall of this wine decanter set and conduct the heat soaking test, which makes it sturdy yet easy to handle. 【Perfect After-sales System】Our Company Stands behind our Products. We believe in the quality of our products. But at the same time, we are also responsible for them. If there is damage or obvious stains, we support unconditional return and exchange. Please contact us if you have problem and we will solve the problem UNTIL YOU ARE SATISFIED.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714O1sHJKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NUTRIUPS","source_asin":"B08K8G676M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K8G676M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K8G676M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
