window.products.push({"id":955812,"name":"Aofmee Pitcher, 60oz Glass Pitcher, Water Pitcher with Lid, Iced Tea Pitcher for Fridge, Glass Carafe for Cold or Hot Beverages, Sun Tea Jar for Juice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71apoBhZkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀PRETTY AND PRACTICAL DESIGN - A dining set will never be complete without a beautiful glass pitcher on the side. If you need one, look at the Aofmee Glass Pitcher. With its capacity of 60 ounces, this heat resistant glass pitcher will be an irreplaceable part of your home. It can hold enough of your favorite refreshment, making it perfect for entertaining your guests and family. You also don’t need to worry about storage problems, as this can easily fit your refrigerator. 🍀STURDY GLASS, SAFETY MATERIAL - You would know that our pitcher is designed for durability because the glass is thicker compared to other ones available on the market. Also, you don’t have to worry if this pitcher is safe for the whole family. It is made of borosilicate components proven and tested to be the most reliable type of glass, withstand temperature 0 to 300 ℉. There is also an integrated silicon-type ring for sealing around the lid’s inside lip to avoid and spilling. 🍀VERSATILE & DURABLE - From ice water to tangy lemonade to homemade sangria, this pitcher looks great and pours easily. Perfect for everyday casual dining and all entertainment, and is durable. You can use it to store many kinds of beverages, from hot/ iced tea, juice, milk, brew coffee, or sangria thanks to its 60 oz container. Our glass pitcher can be a wonderful gift choice or a decorative object around your kitchen. 🍀EASY TO CLEAN - The lid is detachable and the stain can be easily cleaned. The wide opening of the pitcher allows you to add fruits, ice, and other garnishes with ease and quickly wash its interior after each use using the included sponge brush. And it is highly recommended to wash the pitcher by hand. 🍀BUY WITH CONFIDENCE - As another layer of protection, this pitcher has polyfoam protection to ensure that the glass water decanter will be secured during transportation. High quality innovative products is our mission and we commit to the first class after-sale service. Encountered any issues? Simply let us know and we will offer a perfect solution as soon as possible. Trust us! Enjoy marvelous products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71apoBhZkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aofmee","source_asin":"B09JXJBB11","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JXJBB11","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JXJBB11","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
