window.products.push({"id":955943,"name":"Happy Fall Y'all Pillow Covers Set of 4, Autumn Pumpkin and Maple Leaf Throw Pillow Covers 18x18 Inch, Fall Harvest Pillow Covers Decoration Thanksgiv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HJY3XDjvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heyflage's exclusive decorative gift for autumn In this autumn, we have produced more sophisticated and beautiful fall pillow cover, which are convenient to use, do not take up space and easy to store. Matched with fall pillow cover that belong to the autumn pumpkin pattern, with bright colors and diverse styles make the autumn farmhouse more full of atmosphere. High-Quality Materials & Stitching 1. Autumn pumpkin pillow covers is made of machine-washable encrypted linen, which is more durable and comfortable. 2. Double needles increase the durability of the fall throw pillow covers. 3. The small-foot zipper has a sleek and beautiful appearance and will not scratch people or furniture, and easy to put on and take off, easy to replace. Hidden Zipper The invisible zipper makes the wholePillow Covers more fashionable and beautiful, the zipper is specially reinforced to prevent tearing. How to fill Pillow Coverss? 1. Gently fold the pillow core, and then gently stuff the folded pillow core into the pillow case. 2. After inserting the pillow core into thePillow Covers, please use one hand to gently straighten and place the pillow core so that the four corners are located on each corner of the bed cover. 3. If the zipper starts to stick or jam, please do not pull the zipper forcefully. Gently pull the zipper down along the length of the zipper until it closes completely. Widely Fit These fall pillow covers are great and suitable for cars, beds, sofa, seat, couch, bench, etc. and also can be decorative in Autumn, Thanksgiving and Harvest. What Will You Get? 1. Fall throw pillow covers 18x18 set of 1! 6. Note: The pillow inner core is not included! Washing Tips Machine wash in cold water separately, gently cycle only, dot not bleach!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HJY3XDjvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Heyflage","source_asin":"B09CTGCVZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-955943","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTGCVZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTGCVZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
